Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a witch with ashen hair\Nfluttering in the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,flying in the air on a broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is this beauty,\Nas pretty and lovely as a doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,who makes even the summer sun\Nwant to shine brighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:35.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,These clothes are pretty hot for this season...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:24.96,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Ripper"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:39.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It's kind of creepy here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I've gathered you here\Ntoday to talk about the crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,If you know anything, please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:46.79,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, my Bebe's shoes look\Nlike they're about to fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,--By crime, does she mean {\i1}that{\i0}?\N--Oh, my Bebe's shoes look\Nlike they're about to fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,--The people who live in this\Ncountry really love dolls, huh?\N--I'm sure that's what she's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,--The people who live in this\Ncountry really love dolls, huh?\N--It is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Those of us in the Association\Nalso consider this a serious matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:02:59.63,Main,,0,0,0,,--I'd like your help in\Nrestoring order to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,--She's from the United Magic Association?\N--I'd like your help in\Nrestoring order to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I changed her clothes today. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, how wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--Did you get that fabric\Nfrom that store over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:08.71,Main,,0,0,0,,--I wonder if anything happened...\N--Did you get that fabric\Nfrom that store over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.71,0:03:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,--I wonder if anything happened...\N--I did. It was expensive, but I splurged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucky. I haven't been able to\Nget her new clothes for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see the Ripper, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? The Ripper?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't see the Ripper, but I know\Nthe lives of four women were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:29.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Another victim appeared this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This time, it was a woman with green hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,A fifth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Just this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If we include similar incidents\Nfrom the past few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,there have been more than a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The lives of over a hundred women...\NHow unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It happened seven years ago,\Non the night of a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,A man became a werewolf--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:04:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I heard the culprit was a cat woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I heard that the culprit was\Na mysterious being, neither male nor female,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:06.42,Main,,0,0,0,,from my cousin's friend's\Nboyfriend's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,From who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:08.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:10.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The culprit is a doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It moves in the night, attacking women--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go hide out at my parents' house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:20.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, it sounds pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you. Do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:29.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you a citizen of this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the Night Witch, Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:45.25,Main,,0,0,0,,As you can probably tell, I'm a witch\Nsent by the United Magic Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the Ashen Witch, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:56.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So, do you know about the crimes\Nthat happened in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:58.21,Main,,0,0,0,,About the Ripper?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:05:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're a traveler, then how do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:07.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you were asking\Nthe townspeople about it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't\Nknow anything else about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The people in this town don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:24.21,Main,,0,0,0,,They just keep saying whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:29.67,Main,,0,0,0,,If you find out anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be at that assembly hall,\Nso come find me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll find out anything, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I know dolls are the country's local specialty,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,but they really are everywhere, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"Free dolls"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,They're really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:12.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:15.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The doll--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I made all the dolls in this shop myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mouth is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,If there's one you like,\Nfeel free to take it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:26.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they really free?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:28.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:33.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is that? The store is\Nso rundown--I mean modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:35.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care about money!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want to see everyone's happy faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I make lots of dolls and\Ngive them to the townspeople as presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's noble of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If there's one you like,\Nfeel free to take it, Miss Mage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not a mage--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back. Choose one you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Look, how about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the most popular one recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:01.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:13.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have space in my luggage,\Nbut I appreciate the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.29,Main,,0,0,0,,To say you don't care about money...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:29.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were noble people\Nwith a heart of charity like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:37.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, you'll be in room 5 on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.83,Main,,0,0,0,,There's one here, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,There we go. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This country is just full of dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:31.54,Main,,0,0,0,,All the red brick seems like it\Nmight be bad for my eyes, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:56.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that feels good...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? When did I open it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, after I eat breakfast,\Nshall I go to the next... town...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:40.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:47.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see the Ripper, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,...I know the lives of four women were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hair is... a woman's... life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,As you guessed, this is\Ndefinitely the work of the Ripper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe even a witch\Nwould fall victim to the Ripper...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:18.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, I'll take\Na look at the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:21.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Just stay there, out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm... There's nothing here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:42.21,Main,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything\Nsuspicious under the bed, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I think the most suspicious thing\Nin this room is you, Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not suspicious. I'm conducting a search!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,All that's left is that place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The doll's hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I put the doll by the bedside into the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Thought what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,All the incidents have had this in common:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The victims were all\Nattacked while asleep in bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,the doll inside the room disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:22.46,Main,,0,0,0,,and the doll's hair was scattered in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.75,0:11:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The victim's hair probably\Nbecame the doll's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The doll...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The culprit probably\Ncontrols the dolls with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So, what'll you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What'll I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you go out and investigate in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's catch that cowardly culprit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,cut off their head, and send them\Nto hell to regret what they did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You're getting too far ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:59.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that you're pretty thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:08.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Elaina. The Ashen Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:19.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that doll's hair\Nhas a really nice texture?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:36.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess. It's like human hair--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:44.75,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to get hurt,\Nthen tell us where you got this doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,This is human hair, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:48.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The secret auction...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Secret auction?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,A special auction where\Nspecial dolls like Little A are sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "Little A"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is that secret auction held?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just ahead--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,the place where the secret auction is held.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:21.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If you hide just your eyes, it's obvious\Nwho's behind the mask, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:24.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's getting into the spirit\Nof things that's important here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.21,0:13:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,When you put on a mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:28.67,Main,,0,0,0,,don't you feel like you're doing\Nsomething you shouldn't be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, the fact that it's a secret auction\Nshould make that obvious already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:34.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It feels like an opera house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it used to {\i1}be {\i0}an opera house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make that doll\NMasa's girlfriend today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely win, I'll definitely win,\NI'll definitely win, I'll definitely win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been saving up money for the sake of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.75,0:14:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't leave until I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,My cutesy-wootsy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:10.13,Main,,0,0,0,,They're all desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.13,0:14:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder how they can get\Nso worked up about some dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but isn't it the desire
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:20.29,Main,,0,0,0,,to have unorthodox products\Nthat aren't sold in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the moment you've all been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got tons of wonderful\Nproducts for you today, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:30.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If you've got money, you can buy anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, do you want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:43.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The first product is this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's what the "unorthodox products" are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:14:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Fifty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,A hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,One hundred! Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.04,Main,,0,0,0,,One-fifty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Three hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Three hundred! Sold!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--I wonder if they're all\Ngoing to be dolls like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:14.04,Main,,0,0,0,,--Let's move on. The next one is a gem, too!\N--I wonder if they're all\Ngoing to be dolls like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--Let's move on. The next one is a gem, too!\N--No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Here's the next product!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:26.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is {\i0}the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The third product is this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanna go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:41.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone, thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The showcase for today's auction is this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That doll with the ash-colored hair--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like the one in\Nthe room I was staying in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, it {\i1}is {\i0}the doll that was in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's {\i1}my {\i0}hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:17.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a look! To make the hair\Non these dolls look more real,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,they have real human hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,So it's all hair from the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:27.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:31.79,Main,,0,0,0,,They're underestimating me.\NThey definitely need to die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down now. The bidders don't\Nknow how the hair was obtained.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:36.54,Main,,0,0,0,,They haven't done anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that, these are from the Ripper,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,the one everyone's been\Ntalking about on the streets!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.13,0:16:43.33,Main,,0,0,0,,How about it? Aren't they amazing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it, they're making it hard to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, the auction starts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Her hair's the same color as the doll's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You all are enemies of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:18.17,Main,,0,0,0,,For that crime, you must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Ripper, you're here, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't come out? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you stop being mean to my doll, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:01.33,Main,,0,0,0,,So it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yup, it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,When you visited my shop,\NI thought, "That hair is lovely!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ha, you don't care about money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,you were planning to make all your money\Nhere at the secret auction, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I really don't care about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I always donate the profits\Nfrom the secret auction to the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:35.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Cutting a woman's hair and making her sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.75,0:18:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,even though you said you wanted\Nto see people's happy faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Because?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that I want to see happy faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,My special dolls make the bidders here happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,and when I donate the money from\Nthe auction, it also makes people happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Those faces are the best, aren't they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,But just as amazing are the\Nfaces of people when they're sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:06.88,Main,,0,0,0,,or mad, or laughing--all their different faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Expressions of human emotion\Nare really wonderful, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't contain it any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That angry face of yours is good, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, right, that's enough. Now, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:27.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Miss Mage, I'm actually a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not someone you can win against.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:31.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm a witch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, this is the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:20:01.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey. Thanks for your help, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:03.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What will you do? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you mad? Get more mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And then show me your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,No, show me your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, the case was closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The culprit was taken\Nby the Night Witch, Sheila,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:43.25,Main,,0,0,0,,to a branch of the United Magic Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,She should've gotten the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll deliver you and get the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you happy to get the reward? Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Show me your happy face more--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What, you were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I needed some money,\Nso I thought I'd find some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What did this person do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:24.75,Main,,0,0,0,,She's looking at me with strangely bright eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.75,0:21:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your mad face is even cuter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Her? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, she's the Ripper,\Nwho went around cutting women's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,She's so evil, she even cut\Nthe hair of a traveling witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:44.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? The hair of a traveling witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,She had the same pointy hat and necklace as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:50.88,Main,,0,0,0,,and she had pretty, ashen hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:57.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Ashen hair. Traveling witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:03.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,\Nbut I can tell that you're mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.42,0:22:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you tell me more?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that angry face is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.92,0:22:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the best!
